s fun and adrenaline-filled activity is perfect for beginners and experienced riders looking to explore Bali in a unique way.','1. Single ATV ride (1 person per quad bike)\n2. Challenging jungle, mud, and off-road tracks\n3. Ride through tunnels, rivers, and rice fields\n4. Professional guide and safety briefing\n5. Suitable for beginners and experienced riders\n6. Hotel pick-up and drop-off included','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at ATV base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and boots)\n5. Test ride session\n6. Start ATV adventure (jungle, mud track, tunnel, river)\n7. Finish ride and return to base camp\n8. Shower and refresh\n9. Return transfer to hotel','1. ATV single ride (1 person per bike)\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional guide\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and boots)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink\n9. Lunch','1. Personal expenses\n2. Photo and video documentation\n3. Tips / gratuities',NULL,'1. Minimum age: 12 years old\n2. Maximum weight: 120 kg\n3. Basic driving ability required\n4. Not recommended for pregnant women\n5. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n6. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n7. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n8. Advance booking is required\n9. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali','tour-packages/01KQ28SJ4QKJYRTDQ0KVSTJJF2.jpg',NULL,950000.00,840000.00,755000.00,NULL,'approx. 3 – 5 hours','Ubud , Bali',NULL,5.0,'fa-camera','Adventure',1,0,0,'2026-04-25 12:10:53','2026-07-13 12:14:21'),(69,1,5,'ATV BALI ADVENTURE – TANDEM RIDE EXPERIENCE','Best ATV Ride in Bali for Couples – Jungle Track, Mud, Tunnel & River Adventure','atv-bali-adventure-tandem-ride-experience','Enjoy the exciting ATV Bali Adventure – Tandem Ride in Ubud, perfect for couples and friends who want to share the experience. Ride one ATV together through jungle tracks, muddy paths, rivers, tunnels, and rice fields. This fun and safe adventure is suitable for beginners and offers a memorable off-road experience in Bali.','1. Tandem ATV ride (2 persons in 1 ATV)\n2. Perfect for couples and friends\n3. Explore jungle, mud, and off-road tracks\n4. Ride through tunnels, rivers, and rice fields\n5. Professional guide and safety briefing\n6. Suitable for beginners\n7. Hotel pick-up and drop-off included','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at ATV base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and boots)\n5. Test ride session\n6. Start ATV adventure (jungle, mud track, tunnel, river)\n7. Finish ride and return to base camp\n8. Shower and refresh\n9. Return transfer to hotel','1. Tandem ATV ride (2 persons per bike)\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional guide\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and boots)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink\n9. Lunch','1. Personal expenses\n2. Photo and video documentation\n3. Tips / gratuities\n\nTerms and Conditions\n\n1. Minimum age: 6 years old (passenger)\n2. Minimum age: 12 years old (driver)\n3. Maximum combined weight: 150 kg per ATV\n4. Basic driving ability required\n5. Not recommended for pregnant women\n6. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n7. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n8. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n9. Advance booking is required\n10. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali.',NULL,'1. Minimum age: 6 years old (passenger)\n2. Minimum age: 12 years old (driver)\n3. Maximum combined weight: 150 kg per ATV\n4. Basic driving ability required\n5. Not recommended for pregnant women\n6. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n7. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n8. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n9. Advance booking is required\n10. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali','tour-packages/01KQ29YQXV9EP1RMMF3XBG2C6E.png',NULL,900000.00,805000.00,650000.00,NULL,'Half Day','Ubud, Bali',NULL,5.0,'fa-camera','Adventure',1,0,0,'2026-04-25 12:31:12','2026-07-13 12:15:11'),(70,1,5,'RIVER TUBING BALI – UBUD JUNGLE EXPERIENCE','Best Bali River Tubing – Jungle Adventure, Natural Cave & Fun Rapids','river-tubing-bali-ubud-jungle-experience','Experience the fun and relaxing River Tubing Bali Adventure in Ubud, where you float along a scenic jungle river using a personal tube. Pass through natural caves, small waterfalls, and gentle rapids while enjoying Bali’s lush tropical surroundings. This activity is safe, refreshing, and perfect for those looking for a unique water adventure.','1. Individual river tubing (1 person per tube)\n2. Float through jungle, caves, and waterfalls\n3. Fun and safe rapids suitable for beginners\n4. Unique experience inside natural cave tunnels\n5. Professional guide and safety briefing\n6. Hotel pick-up and drop-off included','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at tubing base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and life jacket)\n5. Transfer to starting point\n6. Start river tubing adventure (approx. 1 – 1.5 hours)\n7. Finish tubing and return to base camp','1. River tubing experience\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional guide\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and life jacket)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink','1. Personal expenses\n2. Meals / lunch\n3. Photo and video documentation\n4. Tips / gratuities',NULL,'1. Minimum age: 6 years old\n2. Maximum age: 65 years old\n3. Basic physical condition required\n4. Not recommended for pregnant women\n5. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n6. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n7. Activity operates in all weather conditions','tour-packages/01KQ77HT44J18AE0HBP52ZVE3T.png',NULL,750000.00,620000.00,580000.00,NULL,'Half Day','Gianyar , Bali',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,'2026-04-27 09:23:17','2026-04-27 10:25:23'),(71,1,5,'ATV BARONG CAVE – SINGLE RIDE EXPERIENCE','Best ATV Ride in Bali – Waterfall, Barong Cave, Jungle & River Adventure','atv-barong-cave-single-ride-experience','ATV tracks in Bali. Ride your own quad bike through jungle trails, muddy tracks, rivers, tunnels, and a unique waterfall section where you ride through flowing water. This adventure combines adrenaline, nature, and fun—perfect for beginners and experienced riders.','1. Single ATV ride (1 person per ATV)\n2. Ride through waterfall track (unique water experience)\n3. Challenging jungle, mud, and off-road trails\n4. Explore underground tunnel and river track\n5. Famous Jambe Asri ATV track in Ubud\n6. Professional guide and safety briefing\n7. Hotel pick-up and drop-off includedFamous Jambe Asri ATV track in Ubud\nProfessional guide and safety briefing','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at Jambe Asri ATV base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and boots)\n5. Test ride session\n6. Start ATV adventure (jungle, mud track, waterfall, tunnel, river)\n7. Finish ride and return to base camp\n8. Shower and refresh\n9. Return transfer to hotel','1. ATV single ride (1 person per bike)\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional guide\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and boots)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink\n9. Lunch','1. Personal expenses\n2. Photo and video documentation\n3. Tips / gratuities',NULL,'1. Minimum age: 12 years old\n2. Maximum weight: 120 kg\n3. Basic driving ability required\n4. Not recommended for pregnant women\n5. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n6. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n7. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n8. Advance booking is required\n9. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali','tour-packages/01KQ7E6BYQ27TW5CQHFX1RRBSE.png',NULL,1250000.00,1150000.00,950000.00,NULL,'Half Day',NULL,NULL,5.0,'fa-camera','Adventure',1,0,0,'2026-04-27 12:02:21','2026-07-13 12:28:18'),(72,1,5,'ATV BARONG CAVE – TANDEM RIDE EXPERIENCE','Best ATV Ride in Bali – Waterfall, Barong Cave, Jungle & River Adventure','atv-barong-cave-tandem-ride-experience','Experience the exciting Barong Cave ATV – Tandem Ride in Ubud, one of the most unique ATV tracks in Bali. Ride together on one ATV through jungle trails, muddy tracks, rivers, and the famous Barong Cave. Enjoy a special waterfall section where you ride through flowing water, creating an unforgettable off-road adventure. Perfect for couples and friends looking for a fun and thrilling experience.','1. Tandem ATV ride (2 persons in 1 ATV)\n2. Explore the famous Barong Cave track\n3. Ride through waterfall and flowing water track\n4. Jungle, mud, and off-road adventure\n5. Tunnel and river experience\n6. Professional guide and safety briefing\n7. Hotel pick-up and drop-off included','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at ATV base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and boots)\n5. Test ride session\n6. Start ATV adventure (jungle, mud track, waterfall, Barong Cave, river)\n7. Finish ride and return to base camp\n8. Shower and refresh\n9. Return transfer to hotel','1. Tandem ATV ride (2 persons per bike)\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional guide\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and boots)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink\n9. Lunch','1. Personal expenses\n2. Photo and video documentation\n3. Tips / gratuities',NULL,'1. Minimum age: 6 years old (passenger)\n2. Minimum age: 12 years old (driver)\n3. Maximum combined weight: 150 kg per ATV\n4. Basic driving ability required\n5. Not recommended for pregnant women\n6. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n7. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n8. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n9. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali','tour-packages/01KQ7DYQ7E9CAHYFFX2HRH1XXJ.png',NULL,1050000.00,950000.00,820000.00,NULL,'Half Day','Ubud, Bali',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,'2026-04-27 12:17:18','2026-07-13 12:28:56'),(73,1,6,'KOMODO ISLAND PRIVATE BOAT SHARING ','Explore Komodo National Park in One Day','komodo-island-private-boat-sharing','Discover the best of Labuan Bajo in a single day trip. Visit Padar Island, Pink Beach, and Komodo Island, then enjoy snorkeling at Manta Point, Taka Makassar, and Siaba Island. A perfect combination of adventure, nature, and relaxation in Komodo National Park.','1. Hotel pick-up & drop-off (Labuan Bajo)\n2. Speedboat tour to Padar Island\n3. Trekking to the iconic Padar viewpoint\n4. Relax at the famous Pink Beach\n5. Komodo Island trekking with local ranger\n6. See the legendary Komodo dragons\n7. Lunch served on board\n8. Swim & take photos at Taka Makassar Sandbank\n9. Snorkeling with manta rays at Manta Point\n10. Snorkeling with sea turtles at Siaba Island\n11. Stunning island scenery & crystal-clear waters\n12. Snorkeling equipment & life jacket included','06:00 – 07:00 (Duration: 1 hour)\nHotel Pickup – Transfer to Labuan Bajo Harbor\nOur team will pick you up from your hotel. Please be ready 10–15 minutes before 06:00.\nEnjoy a comfortable land transfer in an air-conditioned vehicle to the harbor meeting point.\n\n07:00 – 07:30 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nCheck-in & Safety Briefing\nRegistration, ID verification, safety briefing, and itinerary overview. Snorkeling equipment will be distributed.\n\n07:30 – 08:30 (Duration: 1 hour)\nSailing to Padar Island\nCruise across the sea to your first destination while enjoying beautiful ocean views.\n\n08:30 – 10:00 (Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes)\nTrekking & Photo Session at Padar Island\nLight trekking (±30–45 minutes) to the top of Padar Island to enjoy its iconic three-bay panorama.\n\n10:00 – 10:30 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSailing to Pink Beach\n\n10:30 – 11:30 (Duration: 1 hour)\nActivities at Pink Beach\nFree time for snorkeling, swimming, and taking photos at the unique pink sand beach.\n\n11:30 – 12:00 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSailing to Komodo Island\n\n12:00 – 13:00 (Duration: 1 hour)\nKomodo Island Trekking & Lunch\nTrekking with a local ranger to see the Komodo dragons in their natural habitat. Lunch will be served on board afterward.\n\n13:00 – 13:30 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSailing to Taka Makassar\n\n13:30 – 14:00 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSwimming & Photo Stop at Taka Makassar\nEnjoy free time for swimming and capturing photos on the beautiful sandbank.\n\n14:00 – 14:15 (Duration: 15 minutes)\nSailing to Manta Point\n\n14:15 – 14:40 (Duration: 25 minutes)\nSnorkeling with Manta Rays\nGuided snorkeling session with a high chance of spotting manta rays.\n\n14:40 – 15:10 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSailing to Siaba Island\n\n15:10 – 15:40 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nSnorkeling with Sea Turtles at Siaba\nRelaxing snorkeling experience with opportunities to see sea turtles.\n\n15:40 – 16:30 (Duration: 50 minutes)\nReturn to Labuan Bajo Harbor\n\n16:30 – 17:00 (Duration: 30 minutes)\nHotel / Airport Drop-off\nTransfer back to your hotel or airport in an air-conditioned vehicle.','1. Shared boat (join tour, max 16 persons)\n2. Hotel pick-up (Labuan Bajo area)\n3. English-speaking guide\n4. Lunch\n5. Snorkeling equipment\n6. Life jacket','1. Komodo National Park entrance fee\n   * Domestic: IDR 200.000\n   * International: IDR 400.000\n2. Ranger fee (Komodo Island)\n3. Personal expenses',NULL,'1. Booking & Payment\n   Full payment is required to confirm the booking (subject to availability).\n\n2. Cancellation\n   * 48 hours before: 50% charge\n   * Less than 24 hours: no refund\n   * No-show: no refund\n\n3. Weather & Itinerary\n   Tours may change or be rescheduled due to weather or operational reasons.\n\n4. Late Arrival\n   Late guests are considered no-show (no refund).\n\n5. Responsibility\n   Guests must be in good condition. We are not responsible for injury, loss, or damage.\n\n6. Insurance\n   Basic insurance included. Personal insurance is recommended.\n\n7. Exclusions\n   Komodo National Park fees & ranger fees are not included.\n\n8. Force Majeure\n   We are not responsible for cancellations due to unforeseen events (weather, government, etc).','tour-packages/01KQCPG6VAY8SZSX8JAGSNYZQY.png',NULL,1700000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1 Day','Komodi Island',NULL,5.0,'fa-earth-oceania','Island',1,0,49,'2026-04-29 13:22:51','2026-07-27 06:36:16'),(74,1,5,'BUGGY 1000CC BALI ADVENTURE – EXTREME OFF-ROAD EXPERIENCE','Best 1000CC Buggy Ride in Bali – Extreme Jungle, Mud & River Adventure','buggy-1000cc-bali-adventure-extreme-off-road-experience','(CHAT WHATSAPP FOR AVAILIBILITY)\nExperience the ultimate Buggy 1000CC Bali Adventure, designed for adrenaline seekers who want a more powerful and extreme off-road experience. Drive through challenging jungle trails, muddy tracks, rivers, tunnels, and rocky terrain using a high-performance 1000CC buggy. This adventure delivers speed, excitement, and unforgettable scenery in the heart of Bali.','1. Powerful 1000CC off-road buggy\n2. Extreme jungle, mud, and river tracks\n3. Drive through tunnels and rocky terrain\n4. Professional instructor and safety briefing\n5. Suitable for adventure lovers and thrill seekers\n6. Hotel pick-up and drop-off included\n7. Safe and beginner-friendly with guide assistance','1. Hotel pick-up (private car)\n2. Arrival at buggy base camp\n3. Registration and safety briefing\n4. Equipment fitting (helmet and boots)\n5. Test drive session\n6. Start Buggy 1000CC adventure (jungle, mud track, tunnel, river)\n7. Finish ride and return to base camp\n8. Shower and refresh\n9. Return transfer to hotel','1. Buggy 1000CC ride\n2. Private hotel transfer (pick-up and drop-off)\n3. Professional instructor\n4. Safety equipment (helmet and boots)\n5. Insurance coverage\n6. Shower facilities\n7. Towel and locker\n8. Welcome drink\n9. Pool & Jacuzzi acces\n10. Lunch','1. Personal expenses\n2. Meals / lunch\n3. Photo and video documentation\n4. Tips / gratuities\n5. Towel in Pool & Jacuzzi',NULL,'1. Minimum age for driver: 17 years old\n2. Maximum combined weight: 180 kg\n3. Basic driving ability required\n4. Not recommended for pregnant women\n5. Not suitable for participants with serious medical conditions\n6. Participants must follow all safety instructions\n7. Activity operates in all weather conditions\n8. Advance booking is required\n9. Hotel transfer is included for Central Bali areas. Additional charge applies for pick-up and drop-off outside Central Bali','tour-packages/01KR0X7XE08DR3VWPPVH63X6PJ.png',NULL,1648000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Half Day','Ubud, Bali',NULL,5.0,'fa-camera','Adventure',1,0,0,'2026-05-06 15:32:39','2026-07-09 13:55:07');
